# 2026-08-21: tried a floating auto-sized LogicLock region around the ascal
# instance to close a setup miss on pll_hdmi divclk (o_vacpt->o_vpixq_pre,
# both endpoints internal to vendored ascal). QSF syntax eventually parsed
# clean (needed -section_id on every LL_* assignment, not just the trio),
# but the fit log showed Critical Warning (140003): "Current license file
# does not support LogicLock regions. The Quartus Prime software removes
# all the LogicLock regions in your design automatically." This is Quartus
# Prime Lite -- LogicLock is a subscription-only feature here and gets
# silently stripped, so that fit was functionally identical to baseline.
# Reverted; not a usable lever on this license.
